WEBVTT

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.059
they followed the public galleries

00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:35.000
of the events and places
I regularly visited.

00:04:37.417 --> 00:04:38.976
But why?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.643
Why should one have to retreat and hide

00:04:42.667 --> 00:04:45.958
out of fear that something
like this could happen?

00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:50.351
What I post and what I wear

00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:54.101
isn't an invitation
to violate and abuse me.

00:04:54.125 --> 00:04:58.184
The only person that should be
changing their behavior

00:04:58.208 --> 00:04:59.542
is the perpetrators.